OL,3,GNEWSAPopular outdoor pool to remain
OL,4,Aopen year round
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outdoor pool is set to remain open
OL,7,Fthrough autumn and winter for a second
OL,8,Fyear following "a positive response"
OL,9,Ffrom customers.
OL,11,FTonbridge swimming pool - which
OL,12,Foperator tmactive said was England's
OL,13,Ffirst heated outdoor pool - has served
OL,14,Fthe town since 1910.
OL,16,FThe extended season will run from
OL,17,FOctober to March 2027, with the pool
OL,18,Fmaintained at 20-21C (68-69.8 F).
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
