OL,3,GNEWSAPopular outdoor pool to remain
OL,4,Aopen year round
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Wood, chief executive of tmactive,
OL,7,Fsaid the reaction to the outdoor pool
OL,8,Fremaining open has "shown us how much
OL,9,Four customers value having this
OL,10,Foption".
